<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF to seek 50,000T of cottonseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF to seek 50,000T of cottonseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) said on Monday it will invite tenders to buy 50,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal by 11 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>If it passes on the tenders due to high prices, it will re-invite the tenders on Friday, an NLCF official said.</p>
<p>Details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p> POSITION  TONNE   ETA	ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p>  One	6,500   July 10  Inchon</p>
<p>  Two	3,500   July 30  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>  Three    6,500   Aug 10   Inchon</p>
<p>  Four     3,500   Aug 30   Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>  Five     6,500   Sep 10   Inchon</p>
<p>  Six	3,500   Sep 30   Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>  Seven    6,500   Oct 10   Inchon</p>
<p>  Eight    3,500   Oct 10   Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>  Nine     6,500   Nov 10   Inchon</p>
<p>  Ten	3,500   Nov 10   Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
